## 4. End-to-End Data Flow

### 4.1 Pre-Deployment to Spawn Flow
1. `OperatorSelectView` initializes `OperatorSelectionStore` (reads `localStorage` key `bfps.operator.v1`, validates `'MALE' | 'FEMALE'`).
2. `OperatorSelectController` requests `OperatorAssetLoader.loadOperator(selectedId)` -> runs `OperatorRigValidator` -> mounts validated `LOD0` rig onto `OperatorPreviewStage` turntable.
3. User rotates preview (pointer drag updates turntable yaw/pitch within clamped bounds) and toggles `MALE` / `FEMALE`; `OperatorSelectionStore` persists selection immediately.
4. User clicks **Deploy**: `OperatorPreviewStage` disposes preview-only render targets/listeners (retaining cached GLTF/textures in `OperatorAssetLoader`), and `PlayerSpawnController` reads `OperatorSelectionStore.getSelected()` to instantiate `BodycamRigController` + `HitZoneRagdollController`.

### 4.2 Per-Frame & Fixed-Step Runtime Data Flow

```
[1. Gameplay Inputs]
  - Player world velocity (v_world), ground state, crouch factor, stride phase/cadence
  - Discrete impulses: jumpImpulse, landingImpulse, weaponRecoilImpulse (vec3)
        |
        v
[2. Animation & Kinematics Update (Variable dt)]
  - AnimationMixer.update(dt) -> writes base local transforms to primary bones
  - Update world matrices for spine/weapon chain -> resolve socket_weapon_r
  - TwoBoneIKSolver.solve() -> adjusts upperarm_l / lowerarm_l / hand_l to lock onto weapon's ik_hand_l_target
        |
        v
[3. Kinematic Feature Extraction (Zero-alloc scratch vectors)]
  - Transform world velocity & head/torso angular velocity into operator local space (spine_03 / pelvis frames)
  - Compute stride vertical/lateral excitation from locomotion cadence
  - Enqueue pending jump/landing/recoil impulses into SecondarySpringSolver accumulator
        |
        v
[4. Fixed-Step Secondary Physics Loop (120 Hz, max 4 substeps/frame)]
  - Accumulator += clampedFrameDt
  - While accumulator >= FIXED_DT:
      - Step all active Float32Array SoA spring channels (stiffness, damping, mass, external accel + queued impulses)
      - Enforce velocity clamp & position displacement clamp per channel
      - Clear consumed impulse queue; accumulator -= FIXED_DT
  - Compute interpolation alpha = accumulator / FIXED_DT (optional linear blend between prevOffset & currOffset)
        |
        v
[5. Clamped Offset Application (SecondaryRigApplier)]
  - Write clamped translational/rotational deltas to dedicated sec_* bone local transforms (Additive over rest offset)
  - Write optional clamped bicep/tricep/forearm flex/jiggle weights to morphTargetInfluences
  - Rigid gear bones remain untouched by secondary offsets
        |
        v
[6. SkinnedMesh & Camera Sync]
  - scene.updateMatrixWorld() / skeleton.update() uploads bone textures to GPU
  - Sync bodycam THREE.PerspectiveCamera to socket_bodycam_mount (with ADS/headbob blend)
  - Apply head/helmet first-person visibility mask (preserving shadow cast)
  - Sync HitZoneRagdollController bounding capsules/OBBs to current bone matrices (or hand over bone transforms from physics world on death)
```

